  m_Name: Garbage Rule
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ruleDescription:
  - 'I''m very sorry, but we had to leave in a bit of a hurry, and the house isn''t
    tidy enough. '
  - 'Would you kindly tour the house and dispose of trash that way be left behind
    ? '
  - 'Don''t bother to pick up anything that is blue. '
  - 'Gertrude loves this color and she will pick hem up herself. '
  - 'Be warry that once you have visited each room, you won''t be able to pick anything
    left behind, and Gertrude won''t like it if you missed something. '
